[en.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_247]
Code 247. <=Giant Muffin=>

[en.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_247_desc]
Code 247. <=Giant Muffin=> : Aims to develop an entertainment product that can be exported to Cloudsdale. Currently, there is only one potential customer, but the customer has a huge purchasing demand. Please don’t get it wrong, the product is a normal-sized muffin, but the user’s body will become huge in a short time after taking it. Prototype: Muffin.

[en.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_247_TOOLTIP]
§YThere is a certain possibility of failure. §!

[zh.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_247]
代号247.「巨大马芬」

[zh.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_247_desc]
代号247.「巨大马芬」：旨在开发一种可以出口到云中城的娱乐产品，目前只有一位潜在客户，但该客户购买力巨大。请不要误会，产品是一只普通大小的马芬，但是服用者体型会短时间内变得巨大。原型: 马芬。

[zh.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_247_TOOLTIP]
§Y有一定可能性会失败。§!
